+From f893af14497708eb67ed0b6b11786b1c7a5f7461 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
+From: dgabehar <dgabehar@gmail.com>
+Date: Wed, 30 Sep 2026 09:50:39 -0500
+Subject: [PATCH] K2 parser: accept the tool arguments in any order
+
+The tagged-args parser required the schema's required arguments first, in definition order. K2-Horizon
+writes e.g. path before the required pattern; the call then failed to parse and the lenient path surfaced it
+with arguments '{' (Grafana F7 t3 FAIL_BADCALL). K2 (drop_tail) now takes any order of any argument.
+
+Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
+Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01BidfYiPxg2nUvGVowCgTPK
+---
