+From 59b910d753951a80165cb6227fdc7eac43eeef5a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
+From: dgabehar <dgabehar@gmail.com>
+Date: Wed, 30 Sep 2026 10:51:27 -0500
+Subject: [PATCH] K2 guard: turn an end of turn inside an unclosed reasoning
+ block into the block's close tag
+
+Masking EOG alone in an open reasoning block (previous commit) pushed some replayed turns into 4096-token
+repetition loops. The close tag now takes the best EOG logit while the block is open (capped), so the
+model's wish to stop becomes 'close the reasoning'.
+
+Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
+Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01BidfYiPxg2nUvGVowCgTPK
