+From ed3ab13adea95e26d5884558574538d328a0fbc7 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
+From: dgabehar <dgabehar@gmail.com>
+Date: Wed, 30 Sep 2026 14:00:34 -0500
+Subject: [PATCH] K2 guard: repetition breaker for an open reasoning block
+
+A reasoning line (16+ chars) written three times in the block the prompt opened forces the close tag.
+R17 live seed 0 at max_tokens 1500 went into 'Let me check the GitHub releases...' loops from turn 31 and
+kept them alive by replaying them; the model then continues with content or a call.
+
+Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
